    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Feverish and tired since yesterday</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Burning, frequency and urgency; no blood in the urine, no discharge, no loin pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Returning tingling in the left fingers since the fever; no new weakness, imbalance or visual change</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vomiting, diarrhea or abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No back pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Worried about a relapse; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

